        "serverInfo": {
          "name": "gridprims",
          "version": "0.1.0"
        },
        "instructions": "gridprims runs US power grid math and reads public grid data locally and offline. Find a tool with gridprims_search, check its inputs with gridprims_describe, and run it with gridprims_run. Quote the summary sentence with its units, and say the validation level when you report a number. Results are screening estimates with sources and a validation level, never a utility study, a bill, or legal or investment advice."
      }
    }
